The final total sales are 695.60 dollars.

781
00:32:31,105 --> 00:32:32,975
(2nd place: Lee Sung Hoon)

782
00:32:32,975 --> 00:32:34,005
(Total sales: 695.60 dollars)

783
00:32:34,005 --> 00:32:38,205
Thank you.

784
00:32:38,205 --> 00:32:40,375
Congratulations. How cool.

785
00:32:43,415 --> 00:32:46,355
Lee Sung Hoon, survival is secured.

786
00:32:46,355 --> 00:32:48,855
(2nd place Lee Sung Hoon advances to the finals.)

787
00:32:50,185 --> 00:32:51,325
Congratulations.

788
00:32:51,455 --> 00:32:52,825
Amazing.

789
00:32:52,995 --> 00:32:53,995
Let's go.

790
00:32:59,335 --> 00:33:02,235
We always advanced with results that were so close.

791
00:33:02,235 --> 00:33:04,535
When being announced second place,

792
00:33:05,235 --> 00:33:09,345
it felt like a reward for all the hard work.

793
00:33:09,445 --> 00:33:11,275
It was worthwhile and delightful.

794
00:33:12,415 --> 00:33:15,815
The remaining restaurants are Kim Hoon's...

795
00:33:16,645 --> 00:33:17,945
and Lee Yeon Bok's.

796
00:33:21,355 --> 00:33:22,485
Let's see.

797
00:33:22,485 --> 00:33:25,225
Just until now, the two restaurants...

798
00:33:25,225 --> 00:33:27,625
were 497.06 dollars apart in sales.

799
00:33:28,225 --> 00:33:30,125
- That's quite apart.
- Lee Yeon Bok was in the lead.

800
00:33:30,725 --> 00:33:32,065
The sales.

801
00:33:32,065 --> 00:33:33,435
(Yeon Bok is in the lead.)

802
00:33:33,435 --> 00:33:35,165
How much did Kim Hoon use in ingredients?

803
00:33:35,565 --> 00:33:37,235
Please, Father.

804
00:33:40,575 --> 00:33:42,805
If Chef Lee Yeon Bok used less than 1,500 dollars...

805
00:33:43,705 --> 00:33:47,015
(Kim Hoon kept calculating the ingredient cost variables.)

806
00:33:47,015 --> 00:33:48,785
I heard Chef Lee used a lot on ingredients.

807
00:33:48,785 --> 00:33:49,885
He used 2,000 dollars.

808
00:33:49,885 --> 00:33:51,285
- Two thousand dollars?
- No way.

809
00:33:51,445 --> 00:33:53,615
I should've spent much less on the ingredients.

810
00:33:54,515 --> 00:33:55,855
(Current sales)

811
00:33:55,855 --> 00:33:57,755
(Kim Hoon: 1,135 dollars, Lee Yeon Bok: 1,632.06 dollars)

812
00:33:57,755 --> 00:34:00,055
Here's the restaurant...

813
00:34:00,055 --> 00:34:02,495
in third place that has secured survival.

814
00:34:09,535 --> 00:34:10,565
Third place.

815
00:34:10,565 --> 00:34:11,565
(Who will come in final 3rd place?)

816
00:34:16,905 --> 00:34:18,075
With the final sales...

817
00:34:19,045 --> 00:34:20,215
My heart is pounding.

818
00:34:22,085 --> 00:34:23,245
Please.

819
00:34:26,415 --> 00:34:28,085
I'm all scared even though I got eliminated.

820
00:34:28,585 --> 00:34:30,925
I can't watch it. It's hurting me.

821
00:34:31,655 --> 00:34:33,225
So this is how it feels.

822
00:34:33,325 --> 00:34:34,455
With the final sales...

823
00:34:43,753 --> 00:34:44,993
With the final sales...

824
00:34:44,993 --> 00:34:46,323
(Kim Hoon's final sales, Lee Yeon Bok's final sales)

825
00:34:46,323 --> 00:34:49,633
coming to 175.67 dollars,

826
00:34:49,633 --> 00:34:50,893
(Kim Hoon's final sales: 175.67 dollars)

827
00:34:50,893 --> 00:34:52,203
(Lee Yeon Bok's final sales: 165.62 dollars)

828
00:34:53,863 --> 00:34:56,373
Kim Hoon's survival is secured.

829
00:34:56,373 --> 00:34:57,873
(Final 3rd place Kim Hoon advances to the finals.)

830
00:34:57,873 --> 00:35:00,103
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

831
00:35:00,303 --> 00:35:02,873
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

832
00:35:02,873 --> 00:35:04,843
- Thank you.
- Well done.

833
00:35:05,173 --> 00:35:06,643
- You did well.
- Thank you.

834
00:35:06,643 --> 00:35:08,013
Good job.

835
00:35:08,013 --> 00:35:10,183
(Overtook Lee Yeon Bok on ingredient costs)

836
00:35:10,953 --> 00:35:13,583
- Unbelievable.
- Really.

837
00:35:15,923 --> 00:35:17,093
Seriously.

838
00:35:17,793 --> 00:35:18,963
Honestly,

839
00:35:19,523 --> 00:35:20,993
I didn't know we'd come this far.

840
00:35:21,223 --> 00:35:24,063
Even so, I kept telling myself that we could do it.

841
00:35:24,493 --> 00:35:27,333
- We must win.
- Yes. "We must win."

842
00:35:27,333 --> 00:35:28,463
To be frank...

843
00:35:29,873 --> 00:35:31,533
I'm suddenly tearing up.

844
00:35:37,843 --> 00:35:39,013
I can't do it.

845
00:35:41,783 --> 00:35:43,713
I can't get the words out. I can't.

846
00:35:47,923 --> 00:35:49,423
Here's what crossed my mind.

847
00:35:49,953 --> 00:35:51,923
You come to an age where you realise...

848
00:35:51,923 --> 00:35:53,093
how far you can go.

849
00:35:53,093 --> 00:35:54,893
In your 20s, you dream ambitiously.

850
00:35:54,893 --> 00:35:58,093
In your 30s, you slowly realise your limits.

851
00:35:58,763 --> 00:36:01,803
But in this survival show,

852
00:36:03,103 --> 00:36:04,533
I kept telling myself that we could do it...

853
00:36:04,533 --> 00:36:05,973
and didn't set a limit for myself.

854
00:36:05,973 --> 00:36:07,203
I'm so going to win.

855
00:36:08,343 --> 00:36:11,813
(Words like self-hypnosis,)

856
00:36:11,813 --> 00:36:19,123
(keeping him from setting limits on himself)

857
00:36:19,183 --> 00:36:21,953
I must've put a limit on myself until now.

858
00:36:21,953 --> 00:36:24,293
I want to prove myself...

859
00:36:25,393 --> 00:36:27,263
with a good result.

860
00:36:31,933 --> 00:36:33,333
(Final 4th place: Lee Yeon Bok)

861
00:36:33,333 --> 00:36:34,863
Oh, dear.

862
00:36:35,773 --> 00:36:37,333
Oh, my.

863
00:36:37,773 --> 00:36:44,173
Lee Yeon Bok. Ingredient costs were 1,466.44 dollars.

864
00:36:44,473 --> 00:36:47,983
- They were 1,466.44 dollars.
- What?

865
00:36:48,083 --> 00:36:49,483
They used 1,460 dollars?

866
00:36:50,083 --> 00:36:54,223
Lee Yeon Bok's final sales were...

867
00:36:54,783 --> 00:36:56,853
just 10.05 dollars lower than Kim Hoon's.

868
00:36:56,853 --> 00:36:58,963
(10.05-dollar difference with Kim Hoon)

869
00:37:02,263 --> 00:37:03,663
No way.

870
00:37:05,733 --> 00:37:07,133
Ten dollars and five cents.

871
00:37:07,733 --> 00:37:09,373
(Sighing)

872
00:37:09,473 --> 00:37:13,003
All sorts of thoughts went through my head.

873
00:37:14,673 --> 00:37:16,573
Because we always sold out fast,

874
00:37:16,573 --> 00:37:19,383
we wanted to sell as much as possible this time.

875
00:37:19,413 --> 00:37:20,413
(During Round 1)

876
00:37:20,413 --> 00:37:22,283
We'll be out of mianbao xia in no time.

877
00:37:22,653 --> 00:37:25,413
(Ingredient shortage crisis in Round 1)

878
00:37:25,823 --> 00:37:28,153
This is bad. I wonder if we can serve all the orders.

879
00:37:28,153 --> 00:37:30,193
We can serve about ten more orders.

880
00:37:30,193 --> 00:37:31,623
These won't make ten servings.

881
00:37:32,093 --> 00:37:35,863
(Sold out early in Round 2)

882
00:37:35,963 --> 00:37:39,303
In food courts, a lot of people swarm in.

883
00:37:39,303 --> 00:37:42,333
If I sell about 300 servings, I'll win for sure.

884
00:37:43,003 --> 00:37:45,173
I should've spent less on buying ingredients.

885
00:37:45,173 --> 00:37:46,943
(He didn't get as many orders as he'd hoped.)

886
00:37:47,173 --> 00:37:48,973
With the difference of 10.05 dollars,

887
00:37:49,673 --> 00:37:51,543
your business will be closed down.

888
00:37:51,543 --> 00:37:53,513
- It's 10.05 dollars?
- Just 1 more naengmyeon...

889
00:37:53,513 --> 00:37:55,513
You're right. If I had sold just one more naengmyeon...

890
00:37:55,683 --> 00:37:56,813
It was such a pity.

891
00:37:57,683 --> 00:37:59,983
Our fate has already been decided, so it can't be helped.

892
00:38:00,223 --> 00:38:01,553
But it was such a pity.

893
00:38:02,623 --> 00:38:05,323
I've been on many survival shows,

894
00:38:05,863 --> 00:38:06,963
but Street Restaurant Fighter...

895
00:38:07,423 --> 00:38:11,333
As I advanced each level, it was so much fun.

896
00:38:11,693 --> 00:38:14,003
It's funny even as I make jjamppong.

897
00:38:14,263 --> 00:38:15,733
I can't believe one order of jjamppong and mianbao xia...

898
00:38:15,733 --> 00:38:17,203
makes me so happy.

899
00:38:17,533 --> 00:38:19,643
- It was so interesting.
- It's well-boiled.

900
00:38:19,643 --> 00:38:21,803
"What topic awaits me next?"

901
00:38:21,803 --> 00:38:25,443
"What kind of style should I go for?"

902
00:38:25,743 --> 00:38:27,283
I wonder what the mission is now.

903
00:38:28,143 --> 00:38:29,613
I've been doing business for over ten years,

904
00:38:29,613 --> 00:38:31,053
but never a business like this.

905
00:38:31,183 --> 00:38:34,223
(It's not just you. It's the first for me as well.)

906
00:38:34,553 --> 00:38:37,553
I had so much fun until here.

907
00:38:37,553 --> 00:38:40,093
Although I got eliminated in the semifinals,

908
00:38:40,363 --> 00:38:42,963
I look forward to what will come next.

909
00:38:42,963 --> 00:38:44,633
(Goodbye)

910
00:38:49,973 --> 00:38:53,943
As the only contestant who's taken part in every single mission,

911
00:38:54,573 --> 00:38:57,343
it's such a shame that I need to leave...

912
00:38:57,713 --> 00:38:59,413
without doing one last mission.

913
00:38:59,443 --> 00:39:01,083
(Hororok Samgye Soft Tofu)

914
00:39:01,083 --> 00:39:04,183
I got the confidence to improve through this.

915
00:39:04,753 --> 00:39:06,553
(Spring Beef Bone Soup Ready in 5 Minutes)

916
00:39:06,553 --> 00:39:08,283
I got to watch the chefs...

917
00:39:08,383 --> 00:39:10,553
and grow from it.

918
00:39:10,893 --> 00:39:12,153
I was very proud to be here,

919
00:39:12,153 --> 00:39:15,063
and I made many good memories with Seung Jae.

920
00:39:15,193 --> 00:39:17,163
So I'll leave happily.

921
00:39:18,063 --> 00:39:21,963
Personally, I've had so much fun here.

922
00:39:23,133 --> 00:39:24,833
Itaewon Class again...

923
00:39:25,703 --> 00:39:28,303
I stayed away from the restaurant business for a while,

924
00:39:28,573 --> 00:39:30,073
but through this show,

925
00:39:30,273 --> 00:39:33,243
I started thinking, "Should I get back to it?"

926
00:39:33,243 --> 00:39:36,013
I felt the urge come over me.

927
00:39:37,353 --> 00:39:39,053
- You've done enough business.
- What?

928
00:39:39,053 --> 00:39:40,923
- You've done enough business.
- Exactly.

929
00:39:41,053 --> 00:39:42,593
For the first time in a while,

930
00:39:42,593 --> 00:39:44,553
I got this thrilling rush of dopamine.

931
00:39:44,723 --> 00:39:47,123
As I got to feel that...

932
00:39:52,433 --> 00:39:55,563
"I really like doing business. I love it."

933
00:39:56,173 --> 00:39:57,433
That was what I thought.

934
00:39:59,473 --> 00:40:00,843
(Itaewon Class Thai)

935
00:40:00,843 --> 00:40:02,543
(Spring Beef Bone Soup Ready in 5 Minutes)

936
00:40:02,543 --> 00:40:04,173
(Hororok Samgye Soft Tofu)

937
00:40:04,173 --> 00:40:06,343
(The Masked Noodle King)

938
00:40:10,813 --> 00:40:13,583
The three restaurants that have survived...

939
00:40:13,683 --> 00:40:16,393
Round Four, Morning at the Airport. Congratulations.

940
00:40:18,293 --> 00:40:20,163
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

941
00:40:20,423 --> 00:40:22,593
- Congratulations.
- We're back to being enemies.

942
00:40:24,193 --> 00:40:25,733
The current total of the prize money...

943
00:40:27,263 --> 00:40:31,333
is 181,047.46 dollars.

944
00:40:32,203 --> 00:40:33,943
The amount is within my reach now.

945
00:40:35,913 --> 00:40:37,243
You are left with...

946
00:40:37,813 --> 00:40:40,783
just one more business.

947
00:40:41,243 --> 00:40:42,283
The final one.

948
00:40:42,813 --> 00:40:43,883
What is it going to be?

949
00:40:45,383 --> 00:40:48,183
The customers of the final mission...

950
00:40:48,183 --> 00:40:50,923
(The final customers the 3 teams will serve)

951
00:40:51,193 --> 00:40:53,063
- This is very important.
- They're university students.

952
00:40:54,163 --> 00:40:55,193
University students?

953
00:40:57,833 --> 00:41:00,863
(University students)

954
00:41:01,133 --> 00:41:03,503
(The final round will be around universities?)

955
00:41:04,573 --> 00:41:05,603
Foreigners.

956
00:41:08,443 --> 00:41:09,573
University students and foreigners?

957
00:41:09,573 --> 00:41:10,673
International university students.

958
00:41:11,113 --> 00:41:13,643
(International university students?)

959
00:41:14,283 --> 00:41:15,813
Is there a foreign language university?

960
00:41:17,213 --> 00:41:18,753
- Seniors.
- What?

961
00:41:21,983 --> 00:41:22,993
Office workers.

962
00:41:24,353 --> 00:41:25,423
What's this?

963
00:41:26,963 --> 00:41:28,293
Families with children.

964
00:41:30,333 --> 00:41:31,863
And restaurant industry workers.

965
00:41:33,003 --> 00:41:34,963
- All of them.
- All of them are customers.

966
00:41:35,303 --> 00:41:37,073
Street Restaurant Fighter.

967
00:41:37,273 --> 00:41:38,903
- Will it be in a mall?
- The final mission is...

968
00:41:39,743 --> 00:41:41,373
Everyone's Restaurant.

969
00:41:42,443 --> 00:41:44,843
Isn't it a restaurant which can satisfy everyone?

970
00:41:45,743 --> 00:41:46,983
That's what I'd expect for the final mission.

971
00:41:46,983 --> 00:41:48,783
A restaurant to satisfy everyone.

972
00:41:49,553 --> 00:41:52,723
You must complete Everyone's Restaurant...

973
00:41:53,053 --> 00:41:55,123
which will satisfy all the different groups.

974
00:41:56,793 --> 00:41:58,553
This is harder, actually.

975
00:41:59,623 --> 00:42:01,393
For the final round's restaurant,

976
00:42:02,533 --> 00:42:06,363
six of the initial booths are linked to form one big booth.

977
00:42:07,263 --> 00:42:09,703
It will be run like an actual restaurant.

978
00:42:09,703 --> 00:42:11,073
- I see.
- One booth is for the kitchen,

979
00:42:11,073 --> 00:42:12,073
and the other five are the dining areas.

980
00:42:12,073 --> 00:42:14,773
- Like an actual restaurant.
- It's an indoor restaurant.

981
00:42:14,773 --> 00:42:16,073
It's a store.

982
00:42:16,613 --> 00:42:18,913
You must design the new signboard...

983
00:42:18,913 --> 00:42:22,113
and the interior of the restaurant yourself.

984
00:42:22,113 --> 00:42:23,183
(They must design the signboard and the interior themselves too.)

985
00:42:23,553 --> 00:42:27,753
You can buy however many four-persons tables for your booth.

986
00:42:29,023 --> 00:42:31,523
Each table costs 40 dollars.

987
00:42:31,793 --> 00:42:34,023
It'll be deducted from the total revenue.

988
00:42:34,493 --> 00:42:35,793
We need to pay for the tables too?

989
00:42:36,463 --> 00:42:38,793
We need to think about how many tables to buy.

990
00:42:39,333 --> 00:42:42,503
Also, you can hire part-timers.

991
00:42:43,203 --> 00:42:45,003
For each part-timer,

992
00:42:45,003 --> 00:42:46,803
the labour cost of 200 dollars will be deducted.

993
00:42:48,173 --> 00:42:50,873
At least we didn't need to clear the tables, serve,

994
00:42:50,943 --> 00:42:52,213
- or manage the register.
- Exactly.

995
00:42:52,273 --> 00:42:54,643
But this time, we need to do all that.

996
00:42:54,883 --> 00:42:58,013
This round will be a blind evaluation.

997
00:43:00,653 --> 00:43:03,893
The business area of the final round will be revealed.

998
00:43:05,923 --> 00:43:10,363
(Which business area will Everyone's Restaurant be at?)

999
00:43:16,773 --> 00:43:19,673
(Where is the final business area...)

1000
00:43:19,673 --> 00:43:22,673
(where the winner will be decided?)

1001
00:43:23,373 --> 00:43:25,543
(Western inland region)

1002
00:43:25,543 --> 00:43:29,713
(The capital of flavours, Jeonju)

1003
00:43:31,983 --> 00:43:34,253
(Korea's first culinary mecca chosen by the UNESCO)

1004
00:43:34,323 --> 00:43:38,523
(Selected as the Creative City of Gastronomy by UNESCO in 2012)

1005
00:43:38,523 --> 00:43:42,533
(Traditional and modern food coexist.)

1006
00:43:44,333 --> 00:43:48,203
(The final battle ground: Jeonju Hanok Village)

1007
00:43:48,833 --> 00:43:50,133
I hope it works out.

1008
00:43:50,933 --> 00:43:52,773
It was a struggle to come here.

1009
00:43:53,003 --> 00:43:54,343
We made it this far.

1010
00:43:57,173 --> 00:43:58,313
Tonight...

1011
00:43:58,313 --> 00:43:59,943
(Jung Ho Young and Song Hoon)

1012
00:43:59,943 --> 00:44:01,513
I hope we go home smiling.

1013
00:44:03,013 --> 00:44:05,013
I think this is the last chance...

1014
00:44:05,583 --> 00:44:07,323
I can work with Chef Song Hoon like this.

1015
00:44:07,323 --> 00:44:10,223
(The best Japanese cuisine chef and Western cuisine chef)

1016
00:44:10,553 --> 00:44:12,293
You can't come here, Song Hoon.

1017
00:44:12,523 --> 00:44:13,993
- It's you two?
- Yes.

1018
00:44:14,923 --> 00:44:17,093
(Everyone was wary of the two skilled chefs.)

1019
00:44:17,693 --> 00:44:19,733
(What the two chefs prioritised)

1020
00:44:19,863 --> 00:44:21,663
Firstly, it has to taste good.

1021
00:44:21,763 --> 00:44:23,403
I must make sure it tastes good.

1022
00:44:24,103 --> 00:44:27,143
But isn't that being what we are? Being like chefs.

1023
00:44:28,903 --> 00:44:32,543
(With the obsession for taste,)

1024
00:44:34,283 --> 00:44:37,713
(the formidable chefs have made it to the finals.)

1025
00:44:38,413 --> 00:44:39,623
Actually, just once...

1026
00:44:39,723 --> 00:44:42,693
I want to reach the peak.

1027
00:44:45,093 --> 00:44:46,663
It's finally the last round.

1028
00:44:47,963 --> 00:44:50,033
It's really the last dance.

1029
00:44:50,733 --> 00:44:52,933
Since we've made it this far, we must win.

1030
00:44:53,303 --> 00:44:54,703
(Kim Hoon and Kim Jong In)

1031
00:44:54,703 --> 00:44:55,903
I'm starting to feel nervous.

1032
00:44:56,973 --> 00:45:00,103
Our strength is data, actually.

1033
00:45:00,243 --> 00:45:02,143
(Kim Hoon's strategy was clear from Round 1.)

1034
00:45:02,143 --> 00:45:04,073
I believe data doesn't lie.

1035
00:45:04,073 --> 00:45:07,313
(Round 1 data: Office district and steak rice bowl)

1036
00:45:07,643 --> 00:45:09,143
(Round 2 data)

1037
00:45:09,143 --> 00:45:11,753
(Beer festival and sweet fried chicken)

1038
00:45:11,983 --> 00:45:13,883
